WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:03.403
Might as well just grin and bear it.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:04.170
The bear

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.705
selfie has arrived

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.473
with one bear

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:08.041
and Boulder, Colorado,

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.577
seemingly taking his cue from Madonna

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:15.081
Normally the city of Boulder,

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:18.151
open space and Mountain Park's trail cams

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.222
captured bears scratching

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:25.625
or eating or giving viewers a rear view.

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:27.660
But sometimes the bears

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.730
investigate the cameras

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.999
And out of 580

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.769
images captured by one trail cam.

00:00:36.069 --> 00:00:38.671
About 400 or bear selfies.

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.206
So obviously the bear

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.242
was looking for the right angle.

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:45.678
Full on frontal side profile.

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.814
This one is giving me Lolita.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:50.683
Noted one viewer I feel pretty.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.652
Also pretty.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:53.820
I feel pretty.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.889
And witty and gay.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.124
We don't even know if this bear is a girl

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.259
or a boy.

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:01.494
I can't say for sure.

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:02.629
It didn't take that.

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:04.064
That's exactly it.

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:06.066
And just like with humans selfies,

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:09.269
there were regex upon instead of a face

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.005
Wildlife experts never know

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:13.740
which critters will trigger

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.842
their motion activated cameras.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:17.343
Be it a

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:20.146
wild turkey, a prairie dog,

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:25.218
a leaping fox, or a howling coyote.

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:28.421
And now we're howling over 400 bear

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:29.556
selfies.

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:30.723
Playing an actress,

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:33.126
trying to come out of hibernation.

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:33.960
All right, Mr.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.695
DeMille, I'm ready for my costar.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.797
Maybe not that close up

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:41.668
and quit baring your tongue.

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:45.772
Jeanne Moos, CNN,

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:46.406
New York.

